---
description: The grid was created with no modules registered at all.
---

## No Modules Registered

No modules were registered before the grid was created, so it has no features to run. This is most often seen straight after upgrading to v33 or later, where the grid stopped bundling every feature by default.

{% partial file="./_modules-not-registered.mdoc" /%}

## Upgrading to v33+ AG Grid

If you have just upgraded to v33+ then you can find more information about the changes in the [Upgrading To AG Grid v33](./upgrading-to-ag-grid-33/#changes-to-modules--packages) guide.
